	(text "VSET = 1.25 V x R8/(R7+R8) = 0.800 V\nVOUT = VSET x (1 + R2/R3) = 1.000 V\nSoft start and reference filter: tau = (R7 || R8) x C12 = 1.69 ms\nQ3 empties C12 while EN_N is high, so every start is a soft start.\nU2, C11, R3, R8, C12 and Q3 return to GND_S, the quiet ground\ntied to J2 by NT2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bf553e2c-b564-5a7c-9855-8f7a456b2a6d")
	)
	(text "Input 1.5 V to 2.0 V (nominal 1.8 V), output 1.000 V, 0 to 1 A.\nThe 5 V bias powers U1, U2 and U3 and gives the NMOS follower\nits gate drive headroom: about 3.2 V on the gate at 1 A and up\nto 4.98 V near dropout.\nQ1 dissipates up to 1.0 W at VIN 2.0 V and 1 A.\nOutput capacitors: one 330 uF polymer and three 47 uF X5R.\nSimulated results and the design math are in README.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f7380850-7482-53c1-be27-17129ac3aaef")
	)
